DECLARE `s 64(3) purpose` IS ONE OF
    `s 64(3)(a) for, and in relation to, the payment of industrial injuries benefit to persons to whom compensation or benefits were payable under section 111 of, and Schedule 8 to, the 1992 Act before commencement`
    `s 64(3)(b) for claims for the payment of such compensation or benefit to be treated as claims for industrial injuries benefit`
    `s 64(3) some other purpose`

-- src:1248 | (3) The Secretary of State may make regulations—
-- src:1249 | (a) for, and in relation to, the payment of industrial injuries benefit to persons to whom, before the commencement of this section, compensation or benefits were payable under section 111 of, and Schedule 8 to, the Social Security Contributions and Benefits Act 1992;
-- src:1250 | (b) for claims for the payment of such compensation or benefit to be treated as claims for industrial injuries benefit.
