    WHEN `s 69(3) 130A(5) the liability to be taken to be the amount of a rent officer determination` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 69(3) 130A(6) determining the amount of liability a person is treated as having by virtue of regulations under section 137(2)(j)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 69(3) 130A(6) that amount to be the amount of a rent officer determination` THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "without prejudice to the generality of this subsection" means the examples do not close the power; whether the regulations may provide for another matter turns on the rest of section 130A, which is not among the sources
    WHEN `s 69(3) some other matter` THEN NOTHING

